    "Deep links (openclaw://…) are always enabled; the key controls unattended runs.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) are always enabled; the key controls unattended runs."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深层链接（openclaw://…）始终启用；密钥用于控制无人值守运行。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深層連結 (openclaw://…) 一律啟用；金鑰用於控制無人值守執行。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) estão sempre ativados; a chave controla execuções autônomas."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep Links (openclaw://…) sind immer aktiviert; der Schlüssel steuert unbeaufsichtigte Ausführungen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los enlaces profundos (openclaw://…) siempre están activados; la clave controla las ejecuciones desatendidas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ディープリンク（openclaw://…）は常に有効です。キーは無人実行を制御します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"딥 링크(openclaw://…)는 항상 활성화되어 있으며, 키는 무인 실행을 제어합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les liens profonds (openclaw://…) sont toujours activés ; la clé contrôle les exécutions sans surveillance."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) हमेशा सक्षम रहते हैं; कुंजी अनअटेंडेड रन को नियंत्रित करती है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الروابط العميقة (openclaw://…) مفعّلة دائمًا؛ يتحكم المفتاح في عمليات التشغيل غير المراقبة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I deep link (openclaw://…) sono sempre abilitati; la chiave controlla le esecuzioni non presidiate."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep link'ler (openclaw://…) her zaman etkindir; anahtar, gözetimsiz çalıştırmaları kontrol eder."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Глибинні посилання (openclaw://…) завжди ввімкнені; ключ керує автоматичними запусками."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep link (openclaw://…) selalu diaktifkan; kunci mengontrol eksekusi tanpa pengawasan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Głębokie linki (openclaw://…) są zawsze włączone; klucz steruje uruchomieniami bez nadzoru."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) จะเปิดใช้งานอยู่เสมอ; คีย์จะควบคุมการรันแบบไม่ต้องมีผู้ดูแล"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) luôn được bật; khóa kiểm soát các lần chạy không cần giám sát."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) zijn altijd ingeschakeld; de sleutel beheert onbeheerde uitvoeringen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep linkها (openclaw://…) همیشه فعال هستند؛ کلید، اجرای بدون نظارت را کنترل می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) всегда включены; ключ управляет запусками без участия пользователя."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Djuplänkar (openclaw://…) är alltid aktiverade; nyckeln styr obevakade körningar."}}}},
