    "More sign-in options": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More sign-in options"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多登录选项"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多登入選項"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mais opções de login"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weitere Anmeldeoptionen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Más opciones de inicio de sesión"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"その他のサインインオプション"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"추가 로그인 옵션"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Plus d’options de connexion"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अधिक साइन-इन विकल्प"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المزيد من خيارات تسجيل الدخول"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Altre opzioni di accesso"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Daha fazla oturum açma seçeneği"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Більше варіантів входу"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opsi masuk lainnya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Więcej opcji logowania"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ตัวเลือกการลงชื่อเข้าใช้เพิ่มเติม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thêm tùy chọn đăng nhập"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meer aanmeldopties"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"گزینه‌های بیشتر ورود"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Больше вариантов входа"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fler inloggningsalternativ"}}}},
    "Most people pick this Mac — OpenClaw installs everything and keeps it running in the background. You can change this anytime in Settings.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Most people pick this Mac — OpenClaw installs everything and keeps it running in the background. You can change this anytime in Settings."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大多数人会选择这台 Mac — OpenClaw 会安装所有内容，并在后台保持运行。你随时可以在设置中更改。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"多數人會選擇這台 Mac — OpenClaw 會安裝所有項目，並讓它在背景持續執行。你隨時可以在「設定」中變更。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A maioria das pessoas escolhe este Mac — o OpenClaw instala tudo e mantém tudo em execução em segundo plano. Você pode alterar isso a qualquer momento nos Ajustes."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die meisten wählen diesen Mac — OpenClaw installiert alles und hält es im Hintergrund am Laufen. Sie können dies jederzeit in den Einstellungen ändern."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La mayoría elige este Mac: OpenClaw instala todo y lo mantiene en ejecución en segundo plano. Puedes cambiarlo en cualquier momento en Ajustes."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ほとんどの人はこの Mac を選びます — OpenClaw がすべてをインストールし、バックグラウンドで実行し続けます。これはいつでも設定で変更できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"대부분의 사용자는 이 Mac을 선택합니다 — OpenClaw가 모든 것을 설치하고 백그라운드에서 계속 실행되도록 유지합니다. 설정에서 언제든지 변경할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La plupart des personnes choisissent ce Mac — OpenClaw installe tout et le maintient en fonctionnement en arrière-plan. Vous pouvez modifier ce choix à tout moment dans Réglages."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अधिकतर लोग यह Mac चुनते हैं — OpenClaw सब कुछ इंस्टॉल करता है और इसे बैकग्राउंड में चालू रखता है। आप इसे Settings में कभी भी बदल सकते हैं।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يختار معظم الأشخاص جهاز Mac هذا — يثبّت OpenClaw كل شيء ويبقيه قيد التشغيل في الخلفية. يمكنك تغيير ذلك في أي وقت من الإعدادات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La maggior parte delle persone sceglie questo Mac: OpenClaw installa tutto e lo mantiene in esecuzione in background. Puoi modificarlo in qualsiasi momento in Impostazioni."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çoğu kişi bu Mac’i seçer — OpenClaw her şeyi kurar ve arka planda çalışır durumda tutar. Bunu dilediğiniz zaman Ayarlar’da değiştirebilirsiniz."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Більшість користувачів обирають цей Mac — OpenClaw встановить усе й підтримуватиме роботу у фоновому режимі. Ви можете змінити це будь-коли в Налаштуваннях."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kebanyakan orang memilih Mac ini — OpenClaw memasang semuanya dan membuatnya tetap berjalan di latar belakang. Anda dapat mengubahnya kapan saja di Pengaturan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Większość osób wybiera tego Maca — OpenClaw zainstaluje wszystko i będzie utrzymywać działanie w tle. Możesz to zmienić w dowolnym momencie w Ustawieniach."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คนส่วนใหญ่เลือก Mac เครื่องนี้ — OpenClaw จะติดตั้งทุกอย่างและทำให้ทำงานอยู่เบื้องหลัง คุณเปลี่ยนได้ทุกเมื่อใน Settings"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hầu hết mọi người chọn máy Mac này — OpenClaw sẽ cài đặt mọi thứ và duy trì chạy trong nền. Bạn có thể thay đổi bất cứ lúc nào trong Cài đặt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De meeste mensen kiezen deze Mac — OpenClaw installeert alles en houdt het op de achtergrond draaiend. Je kunt dit op elk moment wijzigen in Instellingen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بیشتر افراد این Mac را انتخاب می‌کنند — OpenClaw همه‌چیز را نصب می‌کند و آن را در پس‌زمینه در حال اجرا نگه می‌دارد. هر زمان بخواهید می‌توانید این را در تنظیمات تغییر دهید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Большинство выбирают этот Mac — OpenClaw установит всё необходимое и будет поддерживать работу в фоновом режиме. Вы можете изменить это в любое время в Настройках."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De flesta väljer den här Mac-datorn — OpenClaw installerar allt och håller det igång i bakgrunden. Du kan ändra detta när som helst i Inställningar."}}}},
