    "Note: macOS may require restarting OpenClaw after enabling Accessibility or Screen Recording.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Note: macOS may require restarting OpenClaw after enabling Accessibility or Screen Recording."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意：启用辅助功能或屏幕录制后，macOS 可能需要重启 OpenClaw。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意：macOS 可能需要在啟用輔助使用或螢幕錄製後重新啟動 OpenClaw。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Observação: o macOS pode exigir reiniciar o OpenClaw após ativar Acessibilidade ou Gravação de Tela."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hinweis: macOS erfordert möglicherweise einen Neustart von OpenClaw, nachdem Bedienungshilfen oder Bildschirmaufnahme aktiviert wurden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nota: macOS puede requerir reiniciar OpenClaw después de activar Accesibilidad o Grabación de pantalla."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注: macOS では、Accessibility または Screen Recording を有効にした後、OpenClaw の再起動が必要になる場合があります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"참고: macOS에서는 손쉬운 사용 또는 화면 기록을 활성화한 후 OpenClaw를 다시 시작해야 할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remarque : macOS peut nécessiter le redémarrage d’OpenClaw après l’activation de l’accessibilité ou de l’enregistrement de l’écran."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नोट: Accessibility या Screen Recording सक्षम करने के बाद macOS को OpenClaw रीस्टार्ट करने की आवश्यकता हो सकती है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ملاحظة: قد يتطلب macOS إعادة تشغيل OpenClaw بعد تمكين إمكانية الوصول أو تسجيل الشاشة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nota: macOS potrebbe richiedere il riavvio di OpenClaw dopo l'abilitazione di Accessibilità o Registrazione schermo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not: macOS, Erişilebilirlik veya Ekran Kaydı etkinleştirildikten sonra OpenClaw’ın yeniden başlatılmasını gerektirebilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примітка: macOS може потребувати перезапуску OpenClaw після ввімкнення Accessibility або Screen Recording."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Catatan: macOS mungkin perlu memulai ulang OpenClaw setelah mengaktifkan Accessibility atau Screen Recording."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uwaga: macOS może wymagać ponownego uruchomienia OpenClaw po włączeniu Dostępności lub Nagrywania ekranu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"หมายเหตุ: macOS อาจต้องรีสตาร์ท OpenClaw หลังจากเปิดใช้งาน Accessibility หรือ Screen Recording"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lưu ý: macOS có thể yêu cầu khởi động lại OpenClaw sau khi bật Trợ năng hoặc Ghi màn hình."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opmerking: macOS kan vereisen dat OpenClaw opnieuw wordt gestart nadat Toegankelijkheid of Schermopname is ingeschakeld."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توجه: macOS ممکن است پس از فعال کردن Accessibility یا Screen Recording به راه‌اندازی مجدد OpenClaw نیاز داشته باشد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примечание: macOS может потребовать перезапустить OpenClaw после включения Универсального доступа или записи экрана."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obs! macOS kan kräva att OpenClaw startas om efter att Hjälpmedel eller Skärminspelning har aktiverats."}}}},
