    "Partial: %lld entries missing cost": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Partial: %lld entries missing cost"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分完成：%lld 个条目缺少成本"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分：%lld 筆項目缺少費用"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parcial: %lld entradas sem custo"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Teilweise: %lld Einträge ohne Kosten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parcial: %lld entradas sin costo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一部: %lld 件のエントリでコストが不足しています"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"부분: %lld개 항목의 비용 누락"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Partiel : %lld entrées sans coût"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आंशिक: %lld प्रविष्टियों में लागत गायब है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"جزئي: %lld إدخالات تفتقد التكلفة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parziale: %lld voci senza costo"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kısmi: %lld girişte maliyet eksik"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Частково: %lld записів без вартості"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sebagian: %lld entri tanpa biaya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Częściowo: brak kosztu dla %lld pozycji"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บางส่วน: %lld รายการไม่มีค่าใช้จ่าย"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Một phần: %lld mục thiếu chi phí"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gedeeltelijk: %lld items zonder kosten"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"جزئی: %lld مورد فاقد هزینه است"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Частично: у %lld записей отсутствует стоимость"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Delvis: %lld poster saknar kostnad"}}}},
    "Password": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Password"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"密码"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"密碼"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Senha"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Passwort"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contraseña"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"パスワード"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"비밀번호"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mot de passe"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"पासवर्ड"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"كلمة المرور"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Password"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parola"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пароль"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kata Sandi"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hasło"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รหัสผ่าน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mật khẩu"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wachtwoord"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"رمز عبور"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пароль"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lösenord"}}}},
    "Paste the token configured on the gateway host. On the gateway host, run `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in an interactive terminal, then paste its output.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paste the token configured on the gateway host. On the gateway host, run `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in an interactive terminal, then paste its output."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"粘贴在 gateway 主机上配置的令牌。在 gateway 主机上，于交互式终端中运行 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`，然后粘贴其输出。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"貼上在 gateway 主機上設定的權杖。在 gateway 主機上，於互動式終端機中執行 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`，然後貼上其輸出。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cole o token configurado no host do gateway. No host do gateway, execute `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` em um terminal interativo e cole a saída."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fügen Sie das auf dem Gateway-Host konfigurierte Token ein. Führen Sie auf dem Gateway-Host `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in einem interaktiven Terminal aus und fügen Sie dann dessen Ausgabe ein."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pega el token configurado en el host del Gateway. En el host del Gateway, ejecuta `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` en una terminal interactiva y luego pega su salida."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayホストで設定されたトークンを貼り付けてください。Gatewayホストで、対話型ターミナルで `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` を実行し、その出力を貼り付けてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"gateway 호스트에 구성된 토큰을 붙여넣으세요. gateway 호스트에서 대화형 터미널로 `openclaw gateway auth-token --show`를 실행한 다음 그 출력을 붙여넣으세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collez le jeton configuré sur l'hôte du gateway. Sur l'hôte du gateway, exécutez `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` dans un terminal interactif, puis collez sa sortie."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"gateway host पर कॉन्फ़िगर किया गया token पेस्ट करें। gateway host पर, एक इंटरैक्टिव टर्मिनल में `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` चलाएँ, फिर उसका आउटपुट पेस्ट करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الصق الرمز المُهيأ على مضيف Gateway. على مضيف Gateway، شغّل `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` في طرفية تفاعلية، ثم الصق مخرجاته."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incolla il token configurato sull'host del gateway. Sull'host del gateway, esegui `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` in un terminale interattivo, quindi incolla il suo output."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway ana bilgisayarında yapılandırılan belirteci yapıştırın. Gateway ana bilgisayarında, etkileşimli bir terminalde `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` komutunu çalıştırın, ardından çıktısını yapıştırın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставте токен, налаштований на хості Gateway. На хості Gateway виконайте `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` в інтерактивному терміналі, потім вставте його вивід."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempelkan token yang dikonfigurasi di host gateway. Di host gateway, jalankan `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` di terminal interaktif, lalu tempelkan outputnya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wklej token skonfigurowany na hoście gateway. Na hoście gateway uruchom `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` w interaktywnym terminalu, a następnie wklej jego wynik."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"วางโทเคนที่กำหนดค่าไว้บนโฮสต์ Gateway บนโฮสต์ Gateway ให้รัน `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` ในเทอร์มินัลแบบโต้ตอบ แล้ววางผลลัพธ์ที่ได้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dán token được cấu hình trên máy chủ gateway. Trên máy chủ gateway, chạy `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` trong terminal tương tác, sau đó dán kết quả của nó."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Plak het token dat op de gateway-host is geconfigureerd. Voer op de gateway-host `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` uit in een interactieve terminal en plak vervolgens de uitvoer."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توکن پیکربندی‌شده روی میزبان Gateway را جای‌گذاری کنید. روی میزبان Gateway، دستور `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` را در یک ترمینال تعاملی اجرا کنید، سپس خروجی آن را جای‌گذاری کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставьте токен, настроенный на хосте Gateway. На хосте Gateway выполните `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` в интерактивном терминале, затем вставьте вывод."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Klistra in token som är konfigurerad på gateway-värden. På gateway-värden kör du `openclaw gateway auth-token --show` i en interaktiv terminal och klistrar sedan in dess utdata."}}}},
    "Paste the token from your gateway": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paste the token from your gateway"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"粘贴来自 gateway 的令牌"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"貼上來自 gateway 的權杖"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cole o token do seu gateway"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fügen Sie das Token aus Ihrem Gateway ein"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pega el token de tu gateway"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway からのトークンを貼り付けてください"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"게이트웨이의 토큰을 붙여넣으세요"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collez le jeton de votre gateway"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अपने gateway से टोकन पेस्ट करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الصق الرمز المميز من الـ gateway الخاص بك"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incolla il token dal tuo gateway"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway'inizden alınan belirteci yapıştırın"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставте токен зі свого gateway"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempel token dari gateway Anda"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wklej token z gateway"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"วางโทเค็นจาก gateway ของคุณ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dán token từ gateway của bạn"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Plak het token van je gateway"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توکن را از gateway خود جای‌گذاری کنید"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставьте токен из вашего gateway"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Klistra in token från din gateway"}}}},
    "Paste to %@": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paste to %@"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"粘贴到 %@"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"貼到 %@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Colar em %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"In %@ einfügen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pegar en %@"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ に貼り付け"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@에 붙여넣기"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Coller dans %@"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ में चिपकाएँ"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اللصق إلى %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incolla in %@"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ öğesine yapıştır"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставити до %@"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempel ke %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wklej do %@"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"วางไปยัง %@"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dán vào %@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Plakken naar %@"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"چسباندن به %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вставить в %@"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Klistra in till %@"}}}},
