    "When enabled, OpenClaw won't install or manage %@. It will only attach to an existing Gateway.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"When enabled, OpenClaw won't install or manage %@. It will only attach to an existing Gateway."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"启用后，OpenClaw 将不会安装或管理 %@。它只会附加到现有的 Gateway。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用時，OpenClaw 不會安裝或管理 %@，只會連接至現有的 Gateway。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quando ativado, o OpenClaw não instalará nem gerenciará %@. Ele apenas se conectará a um Gateway existente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wenn aktiviert, installiert oder verwaltet OpenClaw %@ nicht. Es wird nur an ein bestehendes Gateway angebunden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cuando está activado, OpenClaw no instalará ni gestionará %@. Solo se conectará a un Gateway existente."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有効にすると、OpenClaw は %@ をインストールまたは管理しません。既存の Gateway に接続するだけになります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"활성화하면 OpenClaw가 %@을(를) 설치하거나 관리하지 않습니다. 기존 Gateway에만 연결됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lorsqu'elle est activée, OpenClaw n'installera ni ne gérera %@. Il se connectera uniquement à un Gateway existant."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सक्षम होने पर, OpenClaw %@ को इंस्टॉल या प्रबंधित नहीं करेगा। यह केवल मौजूदा Gateway से जुड़ेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"عند التمكين، لن يقوم OpenClaw بتثبيت أو إدارة %@. سيتصل فقط بـ Gateway موجود."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quando abilitato, OpenClaw non installerà né gestirà %@. Si collegherà solo a un Gateway esistente."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Etkinleştirildiğinde, OpenClaw %@ öğesini kurmaz veya yönetmez. Yalnızca mevcut bir Gateway'e bağlanır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Коли увімкнено, OpenClaw не встановлюватиме та не керуватиме %@. Він лише під'єднуватиметься до наявного Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saat diaktifkan, OpenClaw tidak akan menginstal atau mengelola %@. Ini hanya akan terhubung ke Gateway yang sudah ada."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gdy ta opcja jest włączona, OpenClaw nie zainstaluje ani nie będzie zarządzać %@. Połączy się tylko z istniejącym Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เมื่อเปิดใช้งาน OpenClaw จะไม่ติดตั้งหรือจัดการ %@ แต่จะเชื่อมต่อกับ Gateway ที่มีอยู่เท่านั้น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Khi bật, OpenClaw sẽ không cài đặt hoặc quản lý %@. Nó chỉ kết nối với một Gateway hiện có."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Indien ingeschakeld, installeert of beheert OpenClaw geen %@. Het maakt alleen verbinding met een bestaande Gateway."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وقتی فعال باشد، OpenClaw مورد %@ را نصب یا مدیریت نمی‌کند. فقط به یک Gateway موجود متصل می‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Когда включено, OpenClaw не будет устанавливать или управлять %@. Он только подключится к существующему Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"När det är aktiverat installerar eller hanterar inte OpenClaw %@. Den ansluter bara till en befintlig Gateway."}}}},
